---------------------
   Built into paramenv:
   paramenv.c       paramenv_main.c


2. LicenseRef-UEI-PowerDNA
----------------------------
   Built into paramenv:
   crc32.c

   [REVIEW NOTE - remove before commit] crc32.c carries the UEI PowerDNA
   license ("used on PowerDNA hardware"), which adds restrictions not
   allowed by the GPL, yet it is linked into the GPL-2.0-or-later paramenv
   binary. Relicense crc32.c as GPL-2.0-or-later (UEI owns it) or replace
   it.


3. LicenseRef-UEI-Proprietary
-------------------------------
   Installed scripts/config:
   /usr/sbin/param.cfg  /usr/sbin/paramenvl

   [REVIEW NOTE - remove before commit] These files have no header;
   GPL-2.0-or-later may be the better choice to match paramenv.c.


Files not built/installed for the ARM (SoloX) target
----------------------------------------------------
Windows/Visual Studio project files, tests and other build variants in the
SVN module are not part of the Yocto package and are not covered by this
summary.



